 {,Const}::EvaluateWithMinimalJacobians records (OKVIS_PORT_GRAPH_TPEVAL_EVERY), sampled ViGraph::updateLandmarks()
 per-landmark inputs/outputs (OKVIS_PORT_GRAPH_LM_EVERY calls, OKVIS_PORT_GRAPH_LM_SUB landmarks); portDump payloads of
 the four TwoPose* cost functions in the PROBLEM record of the solver dump (patch 0008, types 7-10: isComputed,
 DeltaX, J column-major, linearisation points), so check_ok_solve evaluates them natively and verifies the result
 against the ORACLE records. (b) Ceres side (ProblemImpl, solver.cc; file problem.bin): every AddParameterBlock /
 SetManifold / AddResidualBlock / RemoveResidualBlock (also the implicit ones of RemoveParameterBlock, in the order of
 its pointer-keyed set) / RemoveParameterBlock / SetParameterBlockConstant / Variable, Problem construction and
 destruction, and the program order (hash, every OKVIS_PORT_GRAPH_PROBLEM_FULL_EVERY-th in full) at every Solve().
